{"ID":"20240506082115-5kas37p","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240506082115-5kas37p","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082115-5kas37p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240625180003-uj91z2t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612085233-2vkoo76\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240625180003-uj91z2t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"204翘根","updated":"20240625180006"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240625180003-uj91z2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625180003-uj91z2t","updated":"20240625180006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（缺）"}]},{"ID":"20240612084537-ojbchq2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612084537-ojbchq2"}},{"ID":"20240612084538-gr9cu1p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612084538-gr9cu1p","updated":"20240612084543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"翘根《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612084538-8tsisu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612084538-8tsisu4","updated":"20240612084538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘寒平（《御览》作味苦平）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612084538-q0jq16l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612084538-q0jq16l","updated":"20240612084538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主下热气，益阴精，令人面说好，明目。久服轻身耐老。生平泽。（旧在《唐本》退中，今移）"}]},{"ID":"20240612084538-6yyj31t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612084538-6yyj31t","updated":"20240612084538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：翘根，神农雷公甘有毒，三月八月采，以作蒸，饮酒病人。（《御览》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612084538-qx3oi2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612084538-qx3oi2a","updated":"20240612084538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生蒿高，二月八月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240612084538-gkcwvz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612084538-gkcwvz3","updated":"20240612084538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案陶宏景云：方药不复用，俗无识者。"}]},{"ID":"20240612084538-vl0o9re","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612084538-vl0o9re","updated":"20240612084538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上草中品四十九种，旧四十六种，考菜部假苏，及《唐本》退中，翘根，宜入此。"}]},{"ID":"20240612084538-jxp5med","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612084538-jxp5med"}},{"ID":"20240612085024-fmny1mx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612085024-fmny1mx","updated":"20240612085031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"翘根《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240612085024-nuse32k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085024-nuse32k","updated":"20240612085024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，寒、平，有小毒。主治下热气，益阴精，令人面悦好，明目。久服轻身，耐老。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085024-nya6xu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085024-nya6xu0","updated":"20240612085024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以作蒸饮酒病患。生嵩高平泽。二月、八月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085024-2civc8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085024-2civc8b","updated":"20240612085024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方药不复用，世无识者也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085024-u3m2l8m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612085024-u3m2l8m"}},{"ID":"20240612085037-ht2stwg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612085037-ht2stwg","updated":"20240612085047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"翘根《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612085037-v78mxyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085037-v78mxyo","updated":"20240612085037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有小毒。以作蒸饮酒病人。生蒿高。二月、八月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085037-17c1ax5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085037-17c1ax5","updated":"20240612085037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文：翘根，味甘，寒、平。主下热气，益阴精，令人面悦好，明目。久服轻身耐老。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085048-r9z0cib","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612085048-r9z0cib"}},{"ID":"20240612085146-k618jy7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612085146-k618jy7","updated":"20240612085151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"翘根《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612085146-npt2346","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085146-npt2346","updated":"20240612085146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，寒平。小毒，主下热气，益阴精。久服悦颜明目耐老，以作蒸饮酒病患。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085147-thus3c3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612085147-thus3c3"}},{"ID":"20240612085156-qpqy6e0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612085156-qpqy6e0","updated":"20240612085200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"翘根《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612085156-taw5sf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085156-taw5sf9","updated":"20240612085156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，寒、平，有小毒。主下热气，益阴精，令人面悦好，明目。久服轻身，耐老。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085156-0t379kp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085156-0t379kp","updated":"20240612085156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以作蒸饮酒病患。生嵩高平泽。二月、八月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085156-i3uiljf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085156-i3uiljf","updated":"20240612085156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶方药不复用，俗无识者。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085156-9kp3wtb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612085156-9kp3wtb"}},{"ID":"20240612085208-exc4vi5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612085208-exc4vi5","updated":"20240612085217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"翘根《吴普本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612085208-rm0j3yv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085208-rm0j3yv","updated":"20240612085208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《御览》卷九百九十一"}]},{"ID":"20240612085208-g69g3kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085208-g69g3kj","updated":"20240612085208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神农、雷公∶甘，有毒。李氏∶苦。二月、八月采。以作蒸饮酒，病患。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085209-114pgtk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612085209-114pgtk"}},{"ID":"20240612085222-ml2alfu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612085222-ml2alfu","updated":"20240612085227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"连翘《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612085222-919twvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085222-919twvn","updated":"20240612085222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」异翘、旱莲子、兰华、三廉，根名连轺、竹根。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085222-eow2193","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085222-eow2193","updated":"20240612085222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（茎、叶）苦、平、无毒。（翘根）甘、寒、平、有小毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085222-51el3cf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085222-51el3cf","updated":"20240612085222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612085222-9qdnw6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085222-9qdnw6e","updated":"20240612085222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、瘰疬结核，用连翘、脂订等分为末，随时吞服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085222-tgcqq61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085222-tgcqq61","updated":"20240612085222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、痔疮肿痛。用连翘煎汤熏洗，后以绿矾加麝香少许敷贴。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085222-yaqbpcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085222-yaqbpcg","updated":"20240612085222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、痈疸肿毒。用连翘草及根各一升，加水一斗六升，煮成三升服。出汗为见效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085222-aaw8kq8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612085222-aaw8kq8"}},{"ID":"20240612085231-74dqznt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612085231-74dqznt","updated":"20240612085239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"翘根《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612085231-asf4oqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085231-asf4oqe","updated":"20240612085231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，寒、平，有小毒。主下热气，益阴精，令人面悦好，明目。久服轻身、耐老。以作蒸饮酒病患。生嵩高平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085231-1log0cf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085231-1log0cf","updated":"20240612085231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二月、八月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085231-kpn333b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085231-kpn333b","updated":"20240612085231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方药不复用，俗无识者也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612085232-z3dt5ji","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612085232-z3dt5ji"}},{"ID":"20240612085233-2vkoo76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612085233-2vkoo76"}}]}